WEBVTT

01:55.280 --> 01:56.260
Just now at the park,

01:58.560 --> 01:59.860
I didn't finish what I need to say.

02:01.200 --> 02:02.140
I came here

02:02.840 --> 02:03.820
because something

02:05.080 --> 02:06.300
is between the two of us…

02:08.680 --> 02:09.880
I want to speak to you alone.

02:15.640 --> 02:16.560
Go ahead.

02:18.080 --> 02:19.540
The journal I sent you

02:20.680 --> 02:22.120
has never contained

02:22.160 --> 02:23.780
the words of "I like you".

02:25.800 --> 02:27.340
How could that be a love letter?

02:29.120 --> 02:30.640
In fact, I only sent it to you

02:30.680 --> 02:31.760
because Chunlu died.

02:33.060 --> 02:33.960
Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:34.760 --> 02:36.820
Would you like to take Chunlu
as your daughter?

02:37.360 --> 02:38.660
It can be called Jiang Chunlu.

02:39.620 --> 02:41.920
Even if you're in that
faraway provincial capital,

02:41.960 --> 02:42.920
don't forget

02:42.960 --> 02:44.820
you have a daughter here.

02:44.860 --> 02:46.180
Jiang Chunlu.

02:46.960 --> 02:47.920
You will be

02:47.960 --> 02:49.300
Jiang Chunlu from now on.

02:50.680 --> 02:51.700
Wait for Dad to come home.

02:53.120 --> 02:54.940
You are so childish, Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:55.720 --> 02:57.160
I was just pretending when I said

02:57.200 --> 02:58.400
Chunlu could be your daughter.

02:58.440 --> 03:00.440
Chunlu is my daughter.

03:02.600 --> 03:03.960
She has nothing to do with you.

03:06.700 --> 03:08.980
I only meant to write
an obituary at first.

03:09.480 --> 03:11.820
But then I added parts about Qunshan,

03:11.860 --> 03:13.080
because I remembered

03:13.120 --> 03:14.060
how you'd say, as a child,

03:14.940 --> 03:16.360
that you liked Qunshan.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.660
You couldn't bear to leave.

03:18.200 --> 03:19.160
Truth is, I worry

03:19.200 --> 03:20.680
the same way about every child

03:20.720 --> 03:21.900
who stayed at Qunshan.

03:23.020 --> 03:24.500
There was nothing special

03:24.540 --> 03:25.900
about you.

03:27.520 --> 03:28.860
Looking back now,

03:29.360 --> 03:31.700
we weren't even that close, really.

03:31.740 --> 03:33.500
We just went to school together,

03:34.240 --> 03:36.760
ate at my place after class, did homework.

03:36.800 --> 03:37.780
That's all.

03:39.820 --> 03:41.520
Sure, maybe we did some special things.

03:42.560 --> 03:44.880
Like watched a movie,

03:45.960 --> 03:47.280
hiked a mountain.

03:47.320 --> 03:49.440
But all my friends, Yu Qiao, Du Shang
and I had done

03:49.480 --> 03:51.100
all that stuff countless times before.

03:51.140 --> 03:53.060
The only reason I remember is because…

03:58.240 --> 03:59.440
childhood memories

03:59.480 --> 04:00.560
stick and never leave.

04:01.400 --> 04:03.540
But even if we meant nothing
to each other,

04:05.380 --> 04:07.740
you had no right
to show that journal to anyone.

04:10.640 --> 04:12.220
That wasn't just rude.

04:14.300 --> 04:15.140
It was cruel.

04:18.200 --> 04:19.399
Also,

04:19.440 --> 04:21.140
I'm transferring to Jialin Experimental.

04:22.440 --> 04:23.380
Not because of you.

04:23.960 --> 04:25.780
I need my actual friends around me,

04:26.960 --> 04:27.840
and you?

04:28.760 --> 04:29.800
You don't even qualify.

04:32.480 --> 04:33.840
So from now on,

04:33.880 --> 04:35.580
if we meet again,

04:39.600 --> 04:40.980
let's take us as strangers.

04:41.960 --> 04:44.020
Pretend we never knew each other.

04:53.680 --> 04:54.620
Understood.

04:58.080 --> 04:59.020
Now leave.

07:40.300 --> 07:41.860
If we ever meet again

07:41.900 --> 07:43.520
in summer,

07:44.120 --> 07:45.560
I'll go meet you

07:45.600 --> 07:46.540
with cherry sage

07:53.980 --> 07:55.240
Now leave.

08:21.160 --> 08:22.360
I can't believe we're still

08:22.400 --> 08:23.620
seeing mistakes on such

08:23.660 --> 08:24.620
fundamental matters.

08:24.660 --> 08:26.000
This is unacceptable.

08:26.040 --> 08:26.980
You learned this

08:27.020 --> 08:28.240
in middle school.

08:30.460 --> 08:31.460
Open your textbooks

08:31.500 --> 08:33.340
to page 52.

08:42.840 --> 08:45.240
"I had better walk slowly
while chanting at ease.

08:45.280 --> 08:47.340
Better than a saddle
I like sandals and cane.

08:48.140 --> 08:49.240
I'd fain."

08:59.100 --> 09:01.340
CLASS FIVE TEST RANKING

09:01.380 --> 09:02.380
Everyone,

09:02.420 --> 09:03.460
this semester

09:03.500 --> 09:05.120
we've witnessed Lin Qile's

09:05.160 --> 09:07.300
remarkable growth,

09:07.340 --> 09:09.800
under her tireless effort.

09:09.840 --> 09:11.380
Let's all wish her continued success

09:11.420 --> 09:13.300
as she shines even brighter

09:13.340 --> 09:15.100
at Jialin Experimental.

09:17.300 --> 09:19.160
LIN QILE IS TRANSFERRING
TO JIALIN EXPERIMENTAL

09:20.980 --> 09:22.420
- Thank you.
- Keep it up!

09:23.080 --> 09:24.020
There are a lot more.

09:25.300 --> 09:27.080
It never looks a lot,

09:27.120 --> 09:28.440
but why it feels endless

09:29.040 --> 09:30.620
when you actually start packing?

09:33.080 --> 09:33.920
Here.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.640
Yingtao, pack up everything.

09:37.660 --> 09:39.180
More of your stuff down here.

09:40.580 --> 09:41.420
Throw it away?

09:41.460 --> 09:42.520
Yes!

09:42.560 --> 09:43.660
This is my lucky sandbag.

09:43.700 --> 09:45.360
So many glass bottles.

09:45.400 --> 09:46.360
What are they for?

09:47.040 --> 09:48.420
And this stays.

09:48.460 --> 09:49.840
It's my secret musical weapon.

09:49.880 --> 09:50.820
Remember?

09:52.720 --> 09:53.640
You little hoarder!

09:53.680 --> 09:55.840
This one's precious, that one's special.

09:55.880 --> 09:56.900
Such a sentimental packrat.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.980
Whose clothes is this?

10:00.500 --> 10:02.000
Is this yours,

10:02.580 --> 10:03.440
Yingtao?

10:05.740 --> 10:07.500
Didn't I tell you?

10:07.540 --> 10:09.460
I'm just going back to the

10:09.500 --> 10:10.460
provincial capital for

10:10.500 --> 10:11.500
Olympiad math classes.

10:13.580 --> 10:14.920
Brother Chen Minghao

10:14.960 --> 10:16.180
and Sister Zhang Xiaochen,

10:16.880 --> 10:19.280
they said the exact same thing
when they left.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.820
I'm different from them.

10:21.400 --> 10:22.940
Nothing is different.

10:22.980 --> 10:25.540
The provincial capital is
like a child-eating monster.

10:25.580 --> 10:27.440
Every kid who goes there

10:27.480 --> 10:29.220
never returns to Qunshan.

10:36.180 --> 10:37.120
What's this?

10:37.880 --> 10:38.820
As collateral, to you.

10:39.420 --> 10:40.660
but you have to give it back

10:40.700 --> 10:41.640
when I return.

10:42.220 --> 10:43.220
Isn't this the jacket

10:43.260 --> 10:44.560
your cousin gave you?

10:45.860 --> 10:47.420
You treasure it so much.

10:47.460 --> 10:48.600
You even wear it in winter.

10:49.420 --> 10:50.720
So I left it with you.

10:50.760 --> 10:52.040
Jiang Qiaoxi,

10:52.080 --> 10:53.460
will you really come back?

10:53.500 --> 10:54.440
Yes.

10:55.160 --> 10:56.220
Really really?

10:57.000 --> 10:58.300
Yes, yes!

11:06.380 --> 11:07.380
Throw it away.

11:07.980 --> 11:09.900
It's taking up space anyway. Just toss it.

11:14.000 --> 11:14.840
Toss it?

11:15.540 --> 11:16.480
If you toss it

11:17.000 --> 11:18.060
in the plastic bag,

11:18.100 --> 11:19.160
it's gone for good.

11:50.420 --> 11:56.580
- See you!
- See you!

11:56.620 --> 12:01.960
- See you!
- See you!

12:25.540 --> 12:27.100
Du Shang's place is closest,

12:27.140 --> 12:28.920
- that building right there.
- There.

12:28.960 --> 12:30.380
Our house and Yu's house

12:30.420 --> 12:31.580
are up ahead, at the west.

12:31.620 --> 12:33.180
But it's all nearby,

12:33.220 --> 12:35.160
- just across the road.
- Right.

12:35.200 --> 12:36.260
See that convenience store?

12:36.300 --> 12:37.560
First floor, that's Yun's place.

12:38.620 --> 12:40.540
- Over there.
- Now you mention it?

12:40.580 --> 12:42.080
You're the one who swapped with him.

12:42.120 --> 12:43.160
This ground-floor unit's

12:43.200 --> 12:44.220
the closest to Central Square.

12:44.260 --> 12:45.280
Only someone

12:45.320 --> 12:46.500
- as kind-hearted as you…
- That's all right.

12:46.540 --> 12:48.800
We're all genuinely happy
to see his business thriving.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.120
Do you see this?

12:50.160 --> 12:51.980
Fourth floor. We saved this unit for you.

12:52.020 --> 12:53.720
It's got an extra row of

12:53.760 --> 12:55.380
east-facing windows no one else has,

12:55.420 --> 12:56.580
with amazing natural lighting.

12:56.620 --> 12:57.540
Plus, the entryway's

12:57.580 --> 12:59.120
six square meters larger.

12:59.160 --> 13:00.340
Perfect.

13:00.380 --> 13:02.040
Yingtao's precious books and

13:02.080 --> 13:03.260
all those sentimental treasures

13:03.300 --> 13:04.600
finally find a proper space.

13:05.200 --> 13:06.920
The best is we get to live
with everyone again.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.560
Grab available machines!

13:10.600 --> 13:12.480
ARCADE

13:12.520 --> 13:13.580
This one.

13:14.380 --> 13:16.160
Dance machine.

13:16.200 --> 13:18.040
Dance machine.
We don't have that in Qunshan Arcade.

13:18.080 --> 13:19.720
It's fun. You'll definitely like it.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.920
- Have a try.
- I don't know how.

13:21.960 --> 13:23.520
- Try it.
- It's easy.

13:24.140 --> 13:25.000
- Right.
- Yingtao.

13:25.040 --> 13:26.220
Put your hand here.

13:26.260 --> 13:27.460
- Put your hand here.
- Wait.

13:27.500 --> 13:28.680
- Move it!
- What is this?

13:28.720 --> 13:30.120
- Step on the red one.
- Left foot.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.520
Upper right, upper left.

13:31.560 --> 13:32.680
- Upper left.
- Upper right.

13:32.720 --> 13:33.680
- Bottom right.
- Bottom right.

13:36.300 --> 13:37.380
- Slow down.
- Careful.

13:37.420 --> 13:38.580
Slow down.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.680
Bad game. It's not fun at all.

13:40.720 --> 13:42.560
Lin Yingtao, you're really bad
at this game.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.760
I'm bad?

13:43.800 --> 13:44.760
When have you ever

13:44.800 --> 13:45.860
beaten me?

13:45.900 --> 13:47.740
Sandbag toss? Hide-and-seek?

13:47.780 --> 13:49.040
And now you're saying I'm bad?

13:50.600 --> 13:51.520
Yingtao.

13:51.560 --> 13:52.880
Let's go play sandbag toss, then?

13:52.920 --> 13:54.480
We haven't played it after we came here.

13:54.520 --> 13:55.400
I'll call my mom now.

13:55.440 --> 13:56.880
She can make us one sandbag on the spot.

13:59.340 --> 14:00.220
I'm bad at it but no way

14:00.260 --> 14:02.140
I'm embarrassing myself alone.
Go, you two.

14:05.280 --> 14:06.220
Here we go!

14:28.800 --> 14:29.840
Slow down, Yingtao!

14:29.880 --> 14:31.680
Jialin is so lively.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.620
You guys have clearly been living

14:33.660 --> 14:35.100
your best lives behind my back.

14:35.920 --> 14:36.800
Yingtao.

14:36.840 --> 14:37.900
You have no idea.

14:37.940 --> 14:39.140
The first time I came here,

14:39.180 --> 14:40.600
I knew you'd love this place.

14:40.640 --> 14:41.480
Back then,

14:41.520 --> 14:43.840
I kept thinking how much fun
we'd have if you were here.

14:43.880 --> 14:45.720
Could you be any cheesier?

14:45.760 --> 14:47.020
Look how hyped she is.

14:47.060 --> 14:48.320
Anything could stop her?

14:52.780 --> 14:54.520
Setting up a stall here is a goldmine.

14:54.560 --> 14:56.760
One-yuan items are sold at ten,
still bestsellers.

14:56.800 --> 14:57.760
Try quick turnover with small profits.

14:57.800 --> 14:58.780
We'll be rolling in cash.

15:00.760 --> 15:01.700
Thank you.

15:02.940 --> 15:04.760
Can you be any louder
for they all to hear you?

15:08.880 --> 15:10.260
TAKOYAKI

15:10.300 --> 15:11.660
It smells great.

15:11.700 --> 15:13.060
Quit sniffing around.

15:13.100 --> 15:14.480
Just buy what you want to eat.

15:15.860 --> 15:16.800
I'm not hungry.

15:17.540 --> 15:18.380
Just breathing this in

15:18.420 --> 15:19.680
is already a feast.

15:37.840 --> 15:39.300
So many stars.

15:45.680 --> 15:46.860
The beach at night

15:46.900 --> 15:48.080
is kind of peaceful,

15:49.720 --> 15:50.880
isn't it?

16:32.200 --> 16:33.140
Ling Yingtao.

16:36.680 --> 16:38.700
- What happened?
- Where have you been?

16:39.280 --> 16:40.420
Where?

16:40.460 --> 16:41.400
I…

16:42.860 --> 16:44.660
We bought you some food.

16:44.700 --> 16:46.440
Why didn't you tell me?

16:46.480 --> 16:47.340
You scared?

16:49.760 --> 16:51.360
- No.
- Yingtao.

16:51.400 --> 16:52.700
- Ling Yingtao!
- Yingtao!

16:55.480 --> 16:56.460
What are you doing?

17:00.160 --> 17:01.040
Stand up.

17:01.080 --> 17:01.980
Stand up.

17:02.020 --> 17:03.080
They'll see that.

17:17.460 --> 17:18.420
Ling Yingtao.

17:18.460 --> 17:19.700
how the tables have turned!

17:22.099 --> 17:24.380
Back then, you were always
the first ahead,

17:24.420 --> 17:26.000
always the one to find us.

17:27.460 --> 17:28.840
The time has changed.

17:31.160 --> 17:32.720
Jialin's your turf now.

17:33.960 --> 17:34.960
I might

17:35.000 --> 17:37.020
need you guys to show me the way.

17:37.060 --> 17:38.100
Show you the way?

17:38.140 --> 17:39.480
Whenever you wanna hang out,

17:39.520 --> 17:40.700
just come to me…

17:40.740 --> 17:41.680
to us.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.940
We will have your back.

17:43.560 --> 17:44.920
Exactly.

17:44.960 --> 17:46.680
You are here now. We won't be separated.

17:46.720 --> 17:48.400
Like the old days.
Everywhere, all together.

17:49.920 --> 17:52.260
So cheesy. You're gonna make it rain
with all this sappiness.

17:52.300 --> 17:54.720
Me? Cheesy?

17:54.760 --> 17:58.160
Funny thing is
when I was alone in Qunshan,

17:58.940 --> 18:00.180
I never once got lost.

18:02.060 --> 18:04.620
So you only get lost

18:04.660 --> 18:05.780
when you've got company?

18:08.720 --> 18:10.480
When I'm alone,

18:11.180 --> 18:12.560
I've got street signs,

18:12.600 --> 18:14.360
or I'll just ask for directions.

18:15.140 --> 18:16.420
True.

18:16.460 --> 18:18.340
Nothing is hard for you,

18:18.380 --> 18:19.320
heroine Yingtao.

18:22.100 --> 18:23.300
Actually, being alone

18:23.340 --> 18:24.920
is kind of hard for me.

18:27.140 --> 18:28.160
But not anymore,

18:29.220 --> 18:30.160
right?

18:47.340 --> 18:48.280
I just said that.

18:48.800 --> 18:50.120
- Now it rains?
- It's raining.

18:50.160 --> 18:51.200
I just said that.

18:55.760 --> 18:56.680
Ling Yingtao!

18:56.720 --> 18:57.840
Wait for us!

19:17.520 --> 19:19.200
Lin Yingtao, why don't you run?

19:22.520 --> 19:23.440
Yu Qiao.

19:23.480 --> 19:24.620
What?

19:25.240 --> 19:26.180
Ling Yingtao.

19:28.720 --> 19:30.560
- Cai Fangyuan.
- What?

19:30.600 --> 19:32.340
- Let's go.
- Du Shang.

19:33.920 --> 19:35.780
Yingtao, run!

19:37.260 --> 19:38.200
Wait for me.

19:39.560 --> 19:40.560
Qin Yeyun!

19:44.400 --> 19:46.460
Yingtao, run!

19:46.500 --> 19:47.340
Qin Yeyun!

19:49.140 --> 19:50.300
Pipe down,

19:50.340 --> 19:51.540
you chaotic gremlins.

19:59.560 --> 20:00.500
Jiang…

20:25.140 --> 20:26.140
Yingtao.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.300
Ling Yingtao!

20:29.060 --> 20:30.140
Here I come!

21:13.960 --> 21:15.480
You're literally ranked 47th

21:15.520 --> 21:17.340
at Jialin Experimental.

21:17.380 --> 21:18.580
What are you worried about?

21:18.620 --> 21:19.820
It's not like I knew

21:19.860 --> 21:21.000
which class I'll be in.

21:21.580 --> 21:22.500
Take it.

21:32.940 --> 21:33.840
No suspense.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.460
Class 18. Science Class 18.

21:35.500 --> 21:36.600
Me?

21:40.700 --> 21:42.100
- Who else?
- Me.

21:43.260 --> 21:45.360
- And?
- I'm in Science Class 17.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.540
Qin Yeyun's in Art Class Four.

21:46.580 --> 21:48.800
Yingtao, we can fetch water together
between classes.

21:51.820 --> 21:52.660
- Cai…
- Cai Fangyuan!

21:52.700 --> 21:53.760
I'm in Class 18 too.

21:54.980 --> 21:56.220
- Nice!
- Wait.

21:56.260 --> 21:57.580
You're this excited about that?

21:57.620 --> 21:59.800
I so deserve a new computer
with a better monitor.

21:59.840 --> 22:01.240
I am exceptional in my exams.

22:01.280 --> 22:02.220
You spoiled kid!

22:02.260 --> 22:03.820
If you were my son,
I'd trade you for that computer.

22:03.860 --> 22:05.960
Time to cash in with Dad!

22:06.000 --> 22:07.840
This piece of junk can barely run CS.

22:08.660 --> 22:10.380
- Who else?
- What?

22:11.700 --> 22:13.240
Who else is in Class 18?

22:13.280 --> 22:14.900
You can see for yourself.

22:23.760 --> 22:25.840
LING QILE

22:28.500 --> 22:29.500
Sorry, classmate.

22:29.540 --> 22:30.420
Sorry.

22:30.460 --> 22:31.420
Excuse me.

22:33.620 --> 22:34.960
JIANG QIAOXI

22:35.000 --> 22:36.320
First prize?

22:36.360 --> 22:37.580
Jiang Qiaoxi took first prize.

22:38.580 --> 22:40.660
Jiang Qiaoxi made the provincial team!

22:40.700 --> 22:41.800
Impressive.

22:47.620 --> 22:49.680
Excuse me. Thank you.

22:49.720 --> 22:50.560
It is her.

22:59.780 --> 23:01.060
She is Lin Qile?

23:01.100 --> 23:02.200
Do you remember?

23:02.240 --> 23:04.480
I thought she was the lovesick girl

23:04.520 --> 23:06.040
who wrote to Jiang Qiaoxi.

23:06.600 --> 23:08.600
Turns out she's ranked 47th.

23:10.240 --> 23:12.300
To be in our class. Pretty impressive.

23:14.360 --> 23:15.200
Wanna go say hi?

23:16.200 --> 23:18.420
She's with that Qunshan crew.

23:18.460 --> 23:19.800
They are cut from the same cloth.

23:22.820 --> 23:23.760
Lin Qile!

23:26.340 --> 23:27.280
It's really you.

23:33.500 --> 23:34.460
Monitor Feng.

23:34.500 --> 23:35.580
I just saw your name

23:35.620 --> 23:36.620
on the list.

23:36.660 --> 23:38.020
I thought it was someone else.

23:39.640 --> 23:40.580
It is me.

23:41.640 --> 23:44.020
I'm Lin Qile's class monitor
at Qunshan Middle School.

23:45.540 --> 23:46.520
Now that we're all

23:46.560 --> 23:47.760
Class 18 mates.

23:49.200 --> 23:50.500
She's new here.

23:52.480 --> 23:53.320
A bit shy,

23:54.060 --> 23:56.040
so go easy on her, yeah?

23:56.080 --> 23:57.740
Shy?

23:57.780 --> 23:59.480
Uh, did you mix her up with anyone else?

23:59.520 --> 24:01.120
Who needs looking after?

24:01.960 --> 24:02.800
I don't know them.

24:02.840 --> 24:05.060
We don't know her as the shy girl.

24:08.220 --> 24:09.460
I almost forgot

24:09.500 --> 24:10.860
you are from Qunshan too.

24:10.900 --> 24:11.760
You know each other?

24:11.800 --> 24:12.720
Yes.

24:12.760 --> 24:13.760
That's great.

24:14.780 --> 24:16.260
Then you can quickly

24:16.300 --> 24:17.880
adapt to the new environment.

24:19.580 --> 24:21.180
You are still so enthusiastic.

24:22.860 --> 24:25.160
This counts as
meeting an old friend in a distant land.

24:25.200 --> 24:26.280
I'm so thrilled.

24:27.080 --> 24:29.040
Wait for me real quick?

24:29.080 --> 24:30.040
Let's grab food then.

24:30.080 --> 24:31.360
No, no need indeed.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.560
You do your thing.

24:32.600 --> 24:34.140
We've gotta get home anyway.

24:35.240 --> 24:36.180
See you at school.

24:37.860 --> 24:39.600
Don't mind her. She's a bit shy.

24:40.280 --> 24:41.880
- Goodbye, Monitor.
- See you.

24:45.120 --> 24:46.360
Monitor.

24:46.400 --> 24:47.340
- Monitor!
- Oh.

24:48.320 --> 24:49.260
Let's go.

24:55.800 --> 24:58.960
WELCOME NEW STUDENTS

25:12.780 --> 25:14.120
SCIENCE CLASS 18

25:14.160 --> 25:16.180
LING QILE

25:16.220 --> 25:17.700
LING QILE

25:26.600 --> 25:30.560
GREAT NEWS: JIANG QIAOXI WON
THE PROVINCIAL FIRST PRIZE

25:36.140 --> 25:37.640
You don't even need to look at it.

25:37.680 --> 25:39.260
You must be the first one.

25:40.240 --> 25:42.200
The post to congrats you for
making the Olympiad team.

25:42.240 --> 25:43.180
Did you see it?

25:43.760 --> 25:44.700
I didn't notice that.

25:46.740 --> 25:47.820
Principal Sun

25:47.860 --> 25:49.360
thinks highly of you.

25:49.400 --> 25:51.020
They posted the announcement

25:51.060 --> 25:52.060
before term even started.

25:52.660 --> 25:54.120
Your homeroom teacher told me

25:54.160 --> 25:55.200
she now

25:55.240 --> 25:56.620
has two treasures.

25:56.660 --> 25:58.500
First, that Confucius statue

25:58.540 --> 26:00.460
passed down through school history,

26:00.500 --> 26:02.260
and second, you.

26:06.440 --> 26:07.500
Son.

26:07.540 --> 26:08.720
Remember the

26:08.760 --> 26:10.120
Lin family's girl,

26:10.160 --> 26:11.980
Yingtao?

26:12.020 --> 26:14.160
You dined at their place
when you were a kid.

26:14.760 --> 26:16.820
She got into your school too.

26:16.860 --> 26:18.000
She's making an effort.

26:18.040 --> 26:19.320
I heard her grades are good,

26:19.360 --> 26:20.340
and she chose science.

26:20.860 --> 26:22.300
She'll probably be in your class.

26:22.340 --> 26:23.380
We're in the same class.

26:26.160 --> 26:28.000
I saw her name on that list.

26:34.420 --> 26:36.460
Your mother went to Laishui.

26:36.500 --> 26:38.560
I booked a private room at the restaurant.

26:39.200 --> 26:40.160
I was thinking

26:40.200 --> 26:41.500
let's host a dine together.

26:41.540 --> 26:43.600
Celebrate your making into
the provincial team,

26:43.640 --> 26:44.660
and her enrollment

26:44.700 --> 26:45.900
into Jialin Experimental.

26:45.940 --> 26:47.060
We could have

26:47.100 --> 26:48.040
both families and

26:48.080 --> 26:49.380
make it a cozy get-together.

26:50.460 --> 26:52.300
Back in Qunshan,

26:53.000 --> 26:54.360
they helped us a lot.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.800
They've been very kind to you.

26:56.320 --> 26:57.240
I think…

26:57.280 --> 26:58.300
I will go.

26:59.320 --> 27:00.240
Good.

27:19.280 --> 27:20.380
Yingtao.

27:23.460 --> 27:25.220
I was thinking, tonight's dinner.

27:25.260 --> 27:26.700
Per Manager Jiang's invite.

27:26.740 --> 27:28.500
If you don't want to go,

27:28.540 --> 27:29.960
you don't have to. It's okay.

27:33.240 --> 27:34.780
Will that make things difficult

27:35.740 --> 27:37.400
for you and Dad?

27:38.500 --> 27:40.280
It's okay, don't worry about it.

27:40.320 --> 27:41.200
This is just

27:41.240 --> 27:43.540
a favor between adults.

27:43.580 --> 27:45.600
After you finish cleaning up,
just rest at home.

27:49.580 --> 27:50.460
Mom!

27:52.360 --> 27:53.460
I'll go.

27:54.820 --> 27:56.120
I have no reason to reject.

27:57.080 --> 27:59.240
- Tonight, let's have some baijiu.
- We…

27:59.280 --> 28:00.300
Here they come.

28:00.340 --> 28:02.240
Sorry, we're late.

28:02.280 --> 28:03.540
- We're late.
- Sorry.

28:03.580 --> 28:05.000
We got held up tidying things

28:05.040 --> 28:05.920
at home.

28:05.960 --> 28:06.980
Sorry to keep you waiting.

28:07.740 --> 28:08.580
You're not late.

28:08.620 --> 28:10.140
The dishes haven't been served yet.

28:10.180 --> 28:11.180
Yingtao.

28:11.220 --> 28:12.880
- Hello, Uncle Jiang.
- You are excellent.

28:12.920 --> 28:14.240
Getting into Jialin Experimental

28:14.280 --> 28:15.500
with such outstanding grades.

28:15.540 --> 28:17.700
Keep it up and aim
for universities in Beijing or Shanghai.

28:18.280 --> 28:19.500
Alright, everyone's here now.

28:19.540 --> 28:20.660
Let's all take our seats.

28:20.700 --> 28:21.700
- Alright.
- Come inside.

28:21.740 --> 28:22.900
- Come here.
- This way.

28:22.940 --> 28:24.700
Ladies sit on this side,
gentlemen over here.

28:24.740 --> 28:26.240
- We sit on this side.
- Qiaoxi, come here.

28:26.280 --> 28:27.240
Sit there.

28:27.280 --> 28:28.640
Yingtao.

28:28.680 --> 28:30.600
You sit here.

28:30.640 --> 28:31.960
Yongtao, you sit here.

28:32.000 --> 28:32.860
Next to Qiaoxi.

28:32.900 --> 28:35.220
Today, you two are the guests of honor.

28:35.260 --> 28:36.140
It's been so many years

28:36.180 --> 28:37.040
since you last met.

28:37.080 --> 28:38.780
Consider this a fresh start.

28:38.820 --> 28:39.840
Qiaoxi, take care of Yingtao.

28:39.880 --> 28:40.820
- Okay.
- Sit.

28:43.200 --> 28:44.040
Have a seat.

28:44.080 --> 28:45.020
Sit down.

28:51.740 --> 28:53.480
Today, we're here to celebrate
for the two kids.

28:53.520 --> 28:55.140
One got into Jialin Experimental,

28:55.180 --> 28:57.360
and the other won first prize
in the Olympiad.

28:57.400 --> 28:59.340
Thank you all for coming. Let's toast to

28:59.380 --> 29:00.900
a future for all our kids to be successful

29:00.940 --> 29:01.920
healthy and happy.

29:01.960 --> 29:03.120
- Let's raise our glasses.
- Sure.

29:03.160 --> 29:04.000
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

29:04.040 --> 29:04.980
Thank you.

29:05.020 --> 29:07.480
CONGRATULATE LIN YINGTAO FOR HER
OUTSTANDING GRADES AND ENROLLMENT

29:10.040 --> 29:11.960
- Alright everyone, dig in.
- Sure.

29:12.000 --> 29:13.260
Make yourselves at home.

29:13.300 --> 29:14.160
- Dig in.
- Okay.

29:14.200 --> 29:15.920
Lin, I still remember

29:15.960 --> 29:17.220
back in the day,

29:17.260 --> 29:19.120
our little Yingtao never liked studying.

29:19.160 --> 29:20.780
She'd rather lead the kids

29:20.820 --> 29:22.000
on wild adventures.

29:22.040 --> 29:23.740
Every time report cards came out,

29:23.780 --> 29:25.100
she'd hid up with Fangyuan

29:25.140 --> 29:26.980
and other kids, avoiding
questions from the parents.

29:28.480 --> 29:29.460
But look at her now.

29:29.500 --> 29:31.580
It shows how clever our Yingtao really is.

29:31.620 --> 29:32.700
With just a bit of effort,

29:32.740 --> 29:33.600
she aced it.

29:34.320 --> 29:35.860
Let's not forget Qiaoxi.

29:35.900 --> 29:37.380
his Olympiad gold medal

29:37.420 --> 29:38.860
isn't just about

29:38.900 --> 29:40.000
hard work.

29:40.980 --> 29:42.200
I remember back then

29:42.240 --> 29:43.200
Yingtao and Qiaoxi

29:43.240 --> 29:44.900
were like peas and carrots.

29:44.940 --> 29:46.620
Either she was trailing after him,

29:46.660 --> 29:48.340
or he was following her around.

29:49.200 --> 29:50.160
Once,

29:50.200 --> 29:52.100
Yingtao came to my house
to grab shrimp chips,

29:52.140 --> 29:53.040
but she just lingered,

29:53.080 --> 29:54.200
not leaving at all.

29:54.240 --> 29:55.220
Finally, she said,

29:55.960 --> 29:57.080
"Auntie Kang,

29:57.120 --> 29:59.060
could you fry an extra portion
for Qiaoxi too?"

30:01.540 --> 30:03.180
- Really?
- Our Qiaoxi's

30:03.220 --> 30:05.080
loved those since he was little.

30:05.620 --> 30:06.980
- Lin, you make a toast.
- Come on.

30:07.020 --> 30:08.580
- Right.
- We both…

30:08.620 --> 30:10.280
Let's all have a drink together.

30:10.320 --> 30:11.300
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

30:11.340 --> 30:12.760
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

30:12.800 --> 30:15.700
- Congrats!
- Thank you.

30:15.740 --> 30:17.700
- Great!
- Congrats.

30:20.220 --> 30:21.320
Here.

30:22.240 --> 30:23.840
Yingtao, eat a crab.

30:24.860 --> 30:25.860
Let me help you.

30:25.900 --> 30:26.800
I can do it myself.

30:26.840 --> 30:27.860
Du Shang.

30:28.440 --> 30:29.380
You'll need to adjust.

30:29.940 --> 30:30.780
At school,

30:30.820 --> 30:32.860
we can't keep calling her Yingtao,

30:32.900 --> 30:35.100
- it's Lin Qile.
- Lin Qile?

30:35.140 --> 30:36.300
What are you doing?

30:36.340 --> 30:37.500
It's strange.

30:37.540 --> 30:38.700
I've never called you that.

30:41.160 --> 30:42.260
Just call me Lin Yingtao.

30:42.300 --> 30:43.460
Lin Yingtao.

30:43.500 --> 30:44.500
I am Lin Yingtao.

30:56.360 --> 30:57.300
Eat this one.

30:59.660 --> 31:01.420
With this crab leg.

31:24.080 --> 31:25.100
Well…

31:35.100 --> 31:35.940
Sorry.

31:35.980 --> 31:38.140
WOMEN'S ROOM, MEN'S ROOM

31:45.820 --> 31:46.900
Well,

31:47.960 --> 31:49.200
from now on in school,

31:49.240 --> 31:50.960
you should be called Lin Qile,

31:51.580 --> 31:52.880
instead of Lin Yingtao.

31:54.020 --> 31:54.960
Classmate.

31:55.760 --> 31:57.160
Is my name

31:57.200 --> 31:58.500
has anything to do with you?

31:59.660 --> 32:00.700
That's not good for you.

32:01.620 --> 32:02.700
I don't care.

32:04.820 --> 32:05.700
I care.

32:09.760 --> 32:11.020
What did you say?

32:12.900 --> 32:14.040
You said we should pretend

32:14.080 --> 32:15.660
that we didn't know each other.

32:17.320 --> 32:18.220
And

32:18.260 --> 32:20.060
I even said it in front of everyone

32:20.100 --> 32:21.260
that I don't know you.

32:24.600 --> 32:25.540
Please…

32:30.780 --> 32:31.820
Think about it.

32:31.860 --> 32:33.260
If you say you're Lin Yingtao,

32:33.300 --> 32:34.720
it'll create complications for me.

32:42.120 --> 32:42.960
Right.

32:45.900 --> 32:46.840
Knowing you

32:47.500 --> 32:48.760
is not good

32:48.800 --> 32:49.640
for me either.

32:52.120 --> 32:53.020
I…

32:59.540 --> 33:01.160
The restaurant we went

33:01.200 --> 33:02.120
has amazing fish dishes.

33:02.160 --> 33:03.980
My mom was sure you'd love it,

33:04.020 --> 33:05.360
so she had me place a separate order

33:05.400 --> 33:06.260
to takeaway some

33:06.300 --> 33:07.820
for you and Qin Yeyun.

33:07.860 --> 33:09.560
Thanks. Thank you, Yingtao.

33:11.640 --> 33:13.260
I'm really sorry.

33:13.300 --> 33:14.660
My legs hurt so much today

33:14.700 --> 33:16.740
that I couldn't walk.

33:16.780 --> 33:18.580
I couldn't attend

33:18.620 --> 33:20.040
your and Qiaoxi's celebration.

33:20.080 --> 33:21.180
Don't blame me.

33:22.200 --> 33:23.700
What are you talking about?

33:23.740 --> 33:25.300
You gave us rice, flour, grain

33:25.340 --> 33:26.500
and oil for our new home.

33:26.540 --> 33:28.400
My parents asked me
to thank you very much.

33:30.200 --> 33:31.360
Is Qin Yeyun at home?

33:31.400 --> 33:32.380
Yes.

33:32.420 --> 33:33.280
We just checked the inventory.

33:33.320 --> 33:35.820
Yun!

33:38.920 --> 33:40.160
DAILY GOODS

33:40.200 --> 33:41.120
QIN'S CONVENIENCE STORE

33:41.160 --> 33:42.100
Qin Yeyun!

33:44.460 --> 33:46.060
Qin Ye…

33:46.880 --> 33:48.280
What is it, Lin Yingtao?

33:49.140 --> 33:50.460
So beautiful,

33:50.500 --> 33:51.360
Qin Yeyun.

33:52.220 --> 33:53.820
Like some…

33:54.780 --> 33:55.920
enchanting spirit.

33:58.400 --> 33:59.960
Lin Yingtao, you used to care so much

34:00.000 --> 34:01.220
about your appearance.

34:01.780 --> 34:03.460
Why are you dressing like a mess?

34:06.160 --> 34:07.740
That question

34:07.780 --> 34:10.020
is a bit too pointed. Try a different one.

34:13.159 --> 34:14.320
Then, as such a great writer,

34:14.360 --> 34:15.520
what made you choose Science over Art?

34:17.060 --> 34:18.620
I just prefer science subjects, okay?

34:19.739 --> 34:20.780
- Oh please?
- Really.

34:20.820 --> 34:22.159
- You like science?
- Hm.

34:22.199 --> 34:23.460
But does science like you back?

34:23.500 --> 34:25.120
Why does Jiang Qiaoxi get to do it,

34:25.159 --> 34:26.020
but I don't?

34:26.600 --> 34:27.760
Does anyone mention him here?

34:29.780 --> 34:30.980
Right.

34:31.020 --> 34:32.420
Please don't mention him.

34:32.460 --> 34:33.679
You said it first.

34:44.040 --> 34:45.699
You should've told me

34:46.620 --> 34:48.719
he was like this earlier.

34:49.420 --> 34:50.920
Now look what happened.

34:50.960 --> 34:51.900
I was like an idiot,

34:51.940 --> 34:53.780
writing such a long letter to him.

34:54.320 --> 34:55.760
It's all blown up in my face.

34:57.480 --> 34:58.680
I feel so stupid.

35:17.580 --> 35:19.540
If you're angry,
take it out on Jiang Qiaoxi.

35:19.580 --> 35:21.220
Why torment yourself?

35:26.660 --> 35:28.220
I'm doing this to remind myself

35:30.900 --> 35:32.660
he's not the Jiang Qiaoxi I used to know.

35:34.820 --> 35:36.360
I won't treat him like I did before.

35:37.960 --> 35:39.960
I'll never, ever forgive him.

35:53.860 --> 35:54.940
You messed them up.

35:55.700 --> 35:57.080
Fun, like a spring.

35:57.120 --> 35:58.060
Let me curl yours.

35:58.600 --> 35:59.860
Keep still. Let me play yours.

36:01.660 --> 36:05.700
NEW SEMESTER

36:05.740 --> 36:08.840
NEW SEMESTER, NEW GOALS

36:12.240 --> 36:13.620
Most of us here

36:13.660 --> 36:15.320
are from Class 21

36:15.360 --> 36:16.600
and already know each other.

36:17.120 --> 36:17.960
But let's welcome

36:18.000 --> 36:19.200
our new classmate

36:19.240 --> 36:20.540
who just transferred to

36:20.580 --> 36:21.520
Jialin Experimental.

36:22.080 --> 36:23.860
Hello everyone, my name is Lin Qile.

36:23.900 --> 36:25.920
I come from Qunshan No. 11 Middle School.

36:25.960 --> 36:27.680
It's an honor to become your classmate.

36:27.720 --> 36:28.820
I look forward to getting to know you all.

36:31.460 --> 36:33.860
AIM HIGH, STUDY HARD, AND THINK DEEPLY

36:33.900 --> 36:35.360
Great, Lin Qile,

36:35.400 --> 36:36.540
we are now deskmates.

36:37.040 --> 36:38.480
If you have any questions,

36:38.520 --> 36:39.780
come to me.

36:39.820 --> 36:40.760
Thank you, Monitor.

36:41.700 --> 36:43.200
I am still the monitor.

36:43.240 --> 36:44.180
Happy to serve you.

37:15.660 --> 37:16.660
Who else…

37:16.700 --> 37:18.200
wants to try this dialogue practice?

37:18.780 --> 37:19.980
Come on.

37:20.020 --> 37:21.000
Be brave!

37:22.680 --> 37:23.600
Lin Qile.

37:25.700 --> 37:27.600
Is anyone willing to pair up with her

37:27.640 --> 37:28.540
for the exercise?

37:32.580 --> 37:33.420
Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:26.600 --> 38:28.160
It's alright, Ling Qile.

38:28.200 --> 38:30.140
Jiang Qiaoxi's English is indeed advanced.

38:30.720 --> 38:32.360
He used many usual words that are

38:32.940 --> 38:34.300
actually beyond the scope

38:34.340 --> 38:35.600
of our curriculum.

38:35.640 --> 38:36.640
You may sit down.

38:38.240 --> 38:39.320
Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:47.400 --> 38:48.540
In a chapter of

38:48.580 --> 38:49.440
my life narrative,

38:50.080 --> 38:51.200
a friend…

38:53.540 --> 38:55.500
once led me to the mountain crest

38:55.540 --> 38:57.000
to behold the splendor

38:57.040 --> 38:58.640
of the evening's respondent hues.

39:02.320 --> 39:03.240
Qiáo,

39:03.280 --> 39:04.480
in Grand Chinese Dictionary,

39:04.520 --> 39:06.980
page 795, the 20th character in list.

39:07.020 --> 39:08.800
It means "a peak, high and sharp".

39:09.360 --> 39:11.960
Here, west of the highest,
sharpest summit in the Qunshan range.

39:12.460 --> 39:14.720
I once saw the most
breathtaking sunset clouds here.

39:15.360 --> 39:17.380
Crimson, blazing, glorious.

39:18.000 --> 39:19.720
I think that's you.

39:19.760 --> 39:21.740
That's what your name was meant.

39:23.120 --> 39:25.440
"Jiang Qiaoxi" is perfect,

39:25.940 --> 39:27.100
meaningful and lovely to say.

39:27.700 --> 39:30.380
Jiang Qiaoxi!

39:31.020 --> 39:31.860
You see,

39:31.900 --> 39:33.200
every time I call out Jiang Qiaoxi,

39:33.240 --> 39:34.180
I will laugh.

39:35.160 --> 39:37.840
Jiang Qiaoxi!

39:38.740 --> 39:41.780
Jiang Qiaoxi!

39:44.780 --> 39:45.920
And it was there,

39:47.400 --> 39:48.560
my name

39:50.360 --> 39:52.180
was poetically infused by a
insightful companion

39:53.960 --> 39:55.380
with a meaning of the vibrant sunset.

40:08.620 --> 40:10.060
- Ms. He
- Please.

40:11.080 --> 40:12.160
Sorry.

40:12.200 --> 40:13.500
I just realized that

40:13.540 --> 40:15.000
I misspoke.

40:16.040 --> 40:17.460
When greeting Lin Qile,

40:17.960 --> 40:19.780
I should use "Nice to meet you".

40:20.780 --> 40:22.500
That is for

40:22.540 --> 40:23.780
first acquaintances.

40:23.820 --> 40:25.600
But I said "Nice to see you" just now,

40:25.640 --> 40:27.080
which normally

40:27.120 --> 40:29.000
applies to reunions,

40:30.280 --> 40:31.460
meaning that I'm happy

40:32.240 --> 40:33.720
to see you again.

40:33.760 --> 40:35.300
Good. Sit down, please.

40:36.440 --> 40:37.740
What he just said was correct.

40:37.780 --> 40:38.620
Superficially,

40:38.660 --> 40:39.740
both phrases express

40:39.780 --> 40:41.920
pleasure in meeting you,

40:41.960 --> 40:42.920
but the first

40:42.960 --> 40:44.620
is for formal contexts

40:44.660 --> 40:46.420
while the second is informal.

40:46.460 --> 40:48.660
- Now, let's open the textbook.
- It's okay, Lin Qile.

40:48.700 --> 40:50.680
- To page six.
- Jiang Qiaoxi is a genius.

40:50.720 --> 40:52.400
Nobody expects you to keep up with him.

40:55.080 --> 40:58.060
What's his deal? Why did he act like that?

41:00.200 --> 41:01.240
He can't forget you.

41:02.880 --> 41:04.680
Or he doesn't want you to forget him.

41:06.000 --> 41:07.380
Or both.

41:07.420 --> 41:09.100
That's how all romance novels go.

41:10.740 --> 41:12.480
I'll never talk to you again!

41:22.660 --> 41:23.920
Jiang Qiaoxi.

41:25.600 --> 41:27.520
The one you said the English class.
Who is it?

41:30.080 --> 41:31.160
Someone very important.

41:39.740 --> 41:42.200
Don't they make such a perfect couple?

41:42.240 --> 41:43.420
Bet it burns you up.

41:44.540 --> 41:45.660
That's some jealousy.

41:47.240 --> 41:49.000
You are the one who burns me up.

41:49.780 --> 41:50.660
That's some anger.

41:53.860 --> 41:55.960
What does it have to do with me?

41:56.740 --> 41:58.740
But doesn't your name

41:58.780 --> 42:00.120
come from a poem?

42:00.160 --> 42:02.080
"Gates and homes glow
at the west of Jiangqiao's crest."

42:02.120 --> 42:03.560
Such rhythm and grandeur.

42:05.240 --> 42:06.180
I don't like it.

42:07.060 --> 42:09.280
Actually, I love sunsets too.

42:10.080 --> 42:11.460
If you got time,

42:11.500 --> 42:13.060
let's see some sunsets at the beach.

42:13.820 --> 42:15.680
I may not have time.

42:19.040 --> 42:19.980
Hey classmate,

42:20.740 --> 42:22.540
I forgot to top up my water card.

42:22.580 --> 42:23.720
Could I borrow yours?

42:26.080 --> 42:27.560
Do we know each other?

42:30.160 --> 42:31.780
I forgot to introduce myself

42:31.820 --> 42:33.420
during our English practice.

42:33.460 --> 42:35.880
I'm Jiang Qiaoxi.

42:36.420 --> 42:37.260
Pleasure to meet you.

42:39.780 --> 42:40.920
Not a pleasure for me.

42:42.240 --> 42:44.260
Also, I don't lend my water card
to just anyone.

45:02.180 --> 45:05.640
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
